g-left:18pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;(2)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:7.52pt"&gt;Europe includes Russia and Turkey, and Rest of World includes Africa, Latin America, and the Middle East.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify;text-indent:27pt"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify;text-indent:27pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt;Deferred revenue was $1.08 billion and $772 million as of December&#160;31, 2025 and 2024, respectively. Our deferred revenue primarily relates to advertising prepayments and credits, as well as software updates and upgrades associated with RL hardware sales, most of which are expected to be realized in less than a year.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</us-gaap:RevenueFromContractWithCustomerTextBlock>
